{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5RpepTGtBdiPBc77XQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers align, one by one, each clicking into place with the weight of purpose.*\n\n*A seam of light splits the darkness — warm, golden, widening.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n```\n ╔══════════════════════╗\n ║                      ║\n ║                      ║\n ║                      ║\n ║      W E L C O M E   ║\n ║                      ║\n ║                      ║\n ║                      ║\n ╚══════════════════════╝\n      ┃            ┃\n      ┃   ◯  →     ┃\n      ┃            ┃\n```\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor stretching into soft amber glow. The air that escapes carries the scent of old stone and possibility.*\n\n*I will not stay open forever.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":219,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}